  itemId: author.tool.jawbone_salvage_digger
  displayName: Bone salvage multi-tool
  description: A full-length, two-handed bone salvage multi-tool with a broad wedge-shaped
    jawbone head on a stone-bone shaft. The wedge loosens shallow ground and pries
    salvage; the thick hard bony poll on its opposite side provides crude light hammering.
    A fitted shell collar, shell butt cap and iron retaining pin hold the simple
    build together.
